        "content": "{\"instance\":\"特斯拉Model 3\",\"constraints\":[{\"id\":1,\"constraint\":\"整车应呈四门、封闭硬顶的中型轿车形态，具有低矮流线型车身轮廓，而非SUV、MPV、皮卡、敞篷车或双门跑车形态。\",\"polarity\":\"must_have\",\"variants\":[],\"source\":\"desc\",\"tier\":\"defining\",\"sources\":[\"glm-5.2\",\"glm-5.3-flash\",\"qwen3.8-flash\",\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"minimax-m3\"],\"provenance\":\"merged\"},{\"id\":2,\"constraint\":\"若呈现中控台区域，内饰应以一块位于中控台中央、横向布置的约15英寸级大尺寸触控屏作为主要控制与信息界面。\",\"polarity\":\"must_have\",\"variants\":[],\"source\":\"desc\",\"tier\":\"defining\",\"sources\":[\"glm-5.2\",\"glm-5.3-flash\",\"qwen3.8-flash\",\"minimax-m3\"],\"provenance\":\"merged\"},{\"id\":3,\"constraint\":\"若车门把手可见，应为嵌入车身表面、与车门外板基本齐平的把手设计。\",\"polarity\":\"must_have\",\"variants\":[],\"source\":\"common_sense\",\"tier\":\"peripheral\",\"sources\":[\"glm-5.2\",\"qwen3.8-flash\",\"deepseek-v4-flash\"],\"provenance\":\"merged\"},{\"id\":4,\"constraint\":\"若车顶区域可见，应具有覆盖乘员舱上方主要区域、从前风挡后方延续至后风挡区域的深色大面积全景玻璃车顶。\",\"polarity\":\"must_have\",\"variants\":[],\"source\":\"common_sense\",\"tier\":\"peripheral\",\"sources\":[\"glm-5.3-flash\",\"deepseek-v4-flash\"],\"provenance\":\"merged\"},{\"id\":5,\"constraint\":\"若可见用于表明整车品牌的徽标或字标，应为特斯拉的T形徽标或TESLA字标。\",\"polarity\":\"must_have\",\"variants\":[\"T形徽标\",\"TESLA字标\"],\"source\":\"common_sense\",\"tier\":\"peripheral\",\"sources\":[\"qwen3.8-flash\",\"minimax-m3\"],\"provenance\":\"merged\"},{\"id\":6,\"constraint\":\"若呈现驾驶位内饰，方向盘正前方不得设置独立的传统仪表盘或仪表屏；主要行车信息应由中央触控屏显示。\",\"polarity\":\"must_not_have\",\"variants\":[],\"source\":\"common_sense\",\"tier\":\"peripheral\",\"sources\":[\"glm-5.2\",\"glm-5.3-flash\"],\"provenance\":\"merged\"},{\"id\":7,\"constraint\":\"Model 3主体的前脸不得具有传统燃油车式的大面积开放进气格栅，应保持封闭、平滑的车头造型。\",\"polarity\":\"must_not_have\",\"variants\":[],\"source\":\"common_sense\",\"tier\":\"defining\",\"sources\":[\"glm-5.2\",\"glm-5.3-flash\",\"qwen3.8-flash\",\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"minimax-m3\"],\"provenance\":\"merged\"},{\"id\":8,\"constraint\":\"Model 3主体的车尾或车底不得出现排气管、排气尾管或排气尾喉。\",\"polarity\":\"must_not_have\",\"variants\":[],\"source\":\"desc\",\"tier\":\"peripheral\",\"sources\":[\"glm-5.2\",\"glm-5.3-flash\",\"qwen3.8-flash\",\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"minimax-m3\"],\"provenance\":\"merged\"}],\"removed\":[],\"notes\":\"清单已覆盖车型结构、关键内饰布局、典型外观部件及纯电动车判别负向，无需编辑补充。\"}",
